silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is the governed Mittens individual — the domestic cat at the Tartu Animal Clinic whose annual vet exam on 2026-05-18 produced the evidence chunk c-0x7f4a. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor#adapterspecializationsymbol a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.05_granite_substrate.chapters.03_training_pipeline_law.sections.04_adapter_specialization.concrete_anchor#adapterspecializationsymbol" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor#adapterspecializationsymbol silm:hasLongDescription "The AdapterSpecializationSymbol is For the evidence leg: A_evidence = Specialize(evidence, ManifestTrain(D_evidence)) where D_evidence is the sub-diagram of D_Mittens restricted to evidence-typed chunks. A_evidence is specialized to answer questions about information artifacts about Mittens, not about Mittens taxonomy or body mass." .
