silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor#mittenssourcediagram silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensSourceDiagram is the source diagram: functor from typed-leg index category into G_Granite whose colimit is Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
