silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_03_training_pipeline_law_sections_04_adapter_specialization_concrete_anchor#clinicalcareplan77tartu silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicalCarePlan77Tartu is clinical care plan record 77 at Tartu clinic: receives universal-mediator from Mittens apex but not from storage row — concrete proof of strict Hom inclusion. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetCarePlan_77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
